message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Surveillance-Led Intertextuality: A TEI-AI (TEIIA) Modelling Framework for Il Castello dell'anima"
abstract: >-
  TEI-driven and AI-assisted model for the analysis of intertextuality
  (citations, authorial glosses, mystical references) in "Il Castello dell'anima"
  (1692-1693) by Sister Teresa di San Geronimo. Data, TEI schema and controlled
  AI pipeline accompanying the entry on the SSH Open Marketplace (DARIAH).
type: software
